# Perf sprint (huashu-flash): the reports are deliverables and stay tracked;
# only the bulk measurement output and screenshots are ignored. ceilings.json is
# the ratchet itself — it has to be tracked or the limits reset every session.
# session.json is a live login cookie and must never be committed.
